lem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017192732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 198/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2329/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 589/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4495/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.548      1 Template:CEMC_box\n100.00%    7.548      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:31590:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017192732 and revision id 290061. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}